{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square and a triangle have equal perimeters.  The lengths of the three sides of the triangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6c2e02214620736a391421987f1d24d5e4770b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.2 \\text{ cm}$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/6613877255bf7ddbd593859ae0c74c84f6c3efbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8.3 \\text{ cm}$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/b/40be1a50c4300252e256f6f2a92c46a392780f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.5 \\text{ cm}$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />.  The area of the square is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2253bc47cf825b8ca8e74e4d55fdf600224200d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 24\\text{ cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 36\\text{ cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 48\\text{ cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 64\\text{ cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 144\\text{ cm}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"555\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The perimeter of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6d501d7597c11b4074d74217e31fb4435e0f953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.2+8.3+9.5=24\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"185\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore, the perimeter of the square is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d69d9c3b09919fe68ae94c6ccad3316851fd9c29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 \\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />, so its side length is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9beb6c8e3eb5c2aba0e537167bc1474ce65794ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{4}=6 \\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" /> and its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba74e174876838f05470f899c531c8c0ce87c882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36 \\text{ cm}^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/C1_dFnM-G00\">https://youtu.be/C1_dFnM-G00</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title